LangString un.TWTitle 1033 "Uninstall TeXWeave"
LangString un.TWSubtitle 1033 "Choose what to keep after removing the application."
LangString un.TWKeep 1033 "Uninstall and keep settings (recommended)"
LangString un.TWKeepHint 1033 "Keep settings, dictionaries, personal styles, reference library and AI history for a future installation."
LangString un.TWPurge 1033 "Completely uninstall this user's application data"
LangString un.TWPurgeHint 1033 "Remove settings, dictionaries, personal styles, reference library, AI history, caches and verified tools in the default data folder."
LangString un.TWProtect 1033 "Projects outside the application folder and tools outside the default data folder are kept. Only this Windows user's data is cleared."
LangString un.TWConfirm 1033 "Permanently remove this Windows user's TeXWeave data? This cannot be undone."
LangString un.TWCleanupFailed 1033 "Some application data could not be removed. Close TeXWeave and retry. Application files have not been removed."
