LangString un.TWPurge 3082 "Completely uninstall this user's application data"
LangString un.TWPurgeHint 3082 "Remove settings, dictionaries, personal styles, reference library, AI history, caches and verified tools in the default data folder."
LangString un.TWProtect 3082 "Projects outside the application folder and tools outside the default data folder are kept. Only this Windows user's data is cleared."
